en.issue_report.chat_prompt:
Help me file a GitHub issue for {repo}.

[Collected automatically — do not ask me for API keys, transcripts, project files, env vars, usernames, or absolute paths]
- Wisp version: {version}
- OS / architecture: {os} / {arch}
- Model profile: {model}
- Startup timings: {startup}

Guide me in plain language: what happened, steps to reproduce, expected vs actual behavior, and any Run ID or error text I know.
If startup was slow or the window stayed blank, remind me that on Windows release builds the log is at %APPDATA%\science.wisp-science\wisp-science\logs\wisp.log (previous launch: wisp.previous.log).
When we have enough detail, propose a short issue title plus a Markdown body with sections (Problem, Steps to reproduce, Expected, Actual, Environment). Then give a prefilled GitHub link using this base URL: {issue_base}?title=...&body=... Remind me that screenshots must be attached manually on GitHub; Wisp does not upload them.

zh.issue_report.chat_prompt:
请帮我向 {repo} 提交一个 GitHub issue。

【已自动采集，请勿向我索要 API key、transcript、项目文件、环境变量、用户名或绝对路径】
- Wisp 版本：{version}
- OS / 架构：{os} / {arch}
- 模型配置：{model}
- 启动耗时：{startup}

请用中文逐条引导我说明：发生了什么、复现步骤、预期与实际行为，以及我知道的 Run ID 或错误信息。
若启动很慢或长时间白屏，提醒我在 Windows 正式版可把日志发给维护者：%APPDATA%\science.wisp-science\wisp-science\logs\wisp.log（上次启动：wisp.previous.log）。
信息足够后，给出简短 issue 标题和 Markdown 正文（含问题描述、复现步骤、预期、实际、环境等小节），并提供预填链接：{issue_base}?title=...&body=...
提醒截图需在 GitHub 页面手动附加，Wisp 不会上传截图。
